  "description": "Pipe-friendly tools for opening annual Healthcare Cost and\nUtilization Project National Inpatient Sample Parquet files, flagging\ndiagnosis and procedure codes, looking up user-supplied CCSR codes, adding\nexperimental Elixhauser indicators, preparing designs and weights with the\n'survey' package,\napplying supported HCUP labels, adjusting charges and costs, and reviewing\ndisclosure risks. Experimental methods and annual-layout assumptions are\nnot independently verified or scientifically approved.",
